{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24338","headline":"八月三日夜作 · 白居易","name":"八月三日夜作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露白月微明，天凉景物清。\n草头珠颗冷，楼角玉钩生。\n气爽衣裳健，风疎砧杵鸣。\n夜衾香有思，秋簟冷无情。\n梦短眠频觉，宵长起暂行。\n烛凝临晓影，虫怨欲寒声。\n槿老花先尽，莲凋子始成。\n四时无了日，何用叹衰荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24338.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24338","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}